{{!-- The journey — MY story, told as a horizontal timeline. One
rail along the x-axis, a stop per chapter: graduate, Accenture,
Cognizant, Twilio, Education First. The strip scroll-
snaps sideways; animate.js fills the rail and lights each node as
it passes ([data-story]). The last card hands the road to the
reader.

The band runs DARK so the film behind it reads. Nothing is
restyled for it: .home-story re-points the semantic colour tokens
at their dark values and the cards, rail and nodes follow, because
they were painted with tokens rather than literals.

The dates come from the resume (Accenture 03/2018, Cognizant 08/2021,
Twilio 07/2022, Education First 05/2026, B.E. 2013–2017). Keep
journey-stacked.hbs in step when a chapter changes. --}}
<section class="section outer home-story">
    {{!-- The backdrop, three layers deep: the film, a navy blend that
    darkens it into brand colour without greying it, and a blueprint
    grid masked so it fades out at the corners. All decorative, all
    behind the content, none of it interactive. --}}
    <div class="story-bg" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="story-video">
            <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/RZMj7C41AuQ?autoplay=1&amp;mute=1&amp;loop=1&amp;playlist=RZMj7C41AuQ&amp;controls=0&amp;rel=0&amp;playsinline=1&amp;modestbranding=1&amp;iv_load_policy=3&amp;disablekb=1"
                title="" loading="lazy" tabindex="-1"
                allow="autoplay; encrypted-media"
                referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="story-shade"></div>
        <div class="story-grid"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="inner relative">
        <div class="section-head" data-animate>
            <div>
                <span class="kicker">{{> "icons/map-icon"}} {{t "The journey"}}</span>
                <h2>{{t "From graduate to Salesforce GTM engineer"}}</h2>
                <p>{{t "The road so far — every stop taught something you'll find on this site."}}</p>
            </div>
            {{#get "pages" filter="slug:about" limit="1" as |about|}}
                {{#if about.[0]}}
                    <a class="btn btn-inverse story-head-cta" href="{{about.[0].url}}">
                        {{t "Read my story"}} {{> "icons/arrow-right"}}
                    </a>
                {{/if}}
            {{/get}}
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="inner">
        <div class="story-strip" data-story data-animate>
            <div class="story-track">
                <span class="story-rail" aria-hidden="true"><i data-story-fill></i></span>

                <article class="story-stop">
                    <span class="story-node" aria-hidden="true">{{> "icons/graduation-cap"}}</span>
                    <span class="story-tag">{{t "The start"}}</span>
                    <time class="story-year" datetime="2017">2017</time>
                    <h3>{{t "Engineering graduate"}}</h3>
                    <p>{{t "B.E. Computer Science, LNCT Bhopal. Degree in hand, inbox full of applications — the only real asset was the will to learn anything."}}</p>
                </article>

                <article class="story-stop">
                    <span class="story-node" aria-hidden="true">{{> "icons/zap"}}</span>
                    <span class="story-tag">{{t "First break"}}</span>
                    <time class="story-year" datetime="2018-03">2018</time>
                    <h3>Accenture</h3>
                    <p>{{t "Salesforce Engineer. CRM Analytics for consumer-goods trade promotion and telecom — datasets, SAQL, bindings, and my first Sales Cloud reporting."}}</p>
                </article>

                <article class="story-stop">
                    <span class="story-node" aria-hidden="true">{{> "icons/layers"}}</span>
                    <span class="story-tag">{{t "Scale"}}</span>
                    <time class="story-year" datetime="2021-08">2021</time>
                    <h3>Cognizant</h3>
                    <p>{{t "CRM Analytics Consultant. Enterprise clients, dashboards redesigned for speed and usability — owning delivery end to end."}}</p>
                </article>

                <article class="story-stop">
                    <span class="story-node" aria-hidden="true">{{> "icons/signal"}}</span>
                    <span class="story-tag">{{t "GTM era"}}</span>
                    <time class="story-year" datetime="2022-07">2022</time>
                    <h3>Twilio</h3>
                    <p>{{t "Salesforce GTM Engineer. The CRM Analytics owner for Sales Ops — pipeline, funnel, forecast and CPQ, and the first time I met the word GTM."}}</p>
                </article>

                <article class="story-stop is-now">
                    <span class="story-node" aria-hidden="true">{{> "icons/cloud"}}</span>
                    <span class="story-tag"><i class="story-now-ping" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{t "Now"}}</span>
                    <time class="story-year" datetime="2026-05">2026</time>
                    <h3>Education First</h3>
                    <p>{{t "Salesforce Engineer in Budapest, moving reporting from Qlik to CRM Analytics — and writing every lesson down here."}}</p>
                </article>

                <article class="story-stop is-next">
                    <span class="story-node" aria-hidden="true">{{> "icons/avatar"}}</span>
                    <span class="story-tag">{{t "Your turn"}}</span>
                    <time class="story-year is-open">{{t "Next"}}</time>
                    <h3>{{t "You?"}}</h3>
                    <p>{{t "Start your own Salesforce chapter — the courses are free and the path is mapped."}}</p>
                    <a class="btn btn-sm story-cta" href="{{@site.url}}/courses/">{{t "Start here"}} {{> "icons/arrow-right"}}</a>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="story-hint" aria-hidden="true">{{> "icons/arrow-right"}} {{t "drag or scroll sideways"}}</p>
    </div>
</section>
